       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. OCCURSDEPENDING.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 ITEM-COUNT PIC 9(2) VALUE 4.
       01 ITEM-TABLE.
           05 ITEM-ENTRY PIC 9(3)
               OCCURS 1 TO 10 TIMES
               DEPENDING ON ITEM-COUNT.
       01 I PIC 9(2).
       01 TOTAL PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 10 TO ITEM-ENTRY(1)
           MOVE 20 TO ITEM-ENTRY(2)
           MOVE 30 TO ITEM-ENTRY(3)
           MOVE 40 TO ITEM-ENTRY(4)
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > ITEM-COUNT
               ADD ITEM-ENTRY(I) TO TOTAL
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "COUNT: " ITEM-COUNT
           DISPLAY "TOTAL: " TOTAL
           STOP RUN.
